{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "讀呪法，注平上去入者，從\n四聲法借音讀。注半音者，半聲讀。注二合者，半上字連聲讀。注重字者，帶㗋聲重讀。注長者，長聲讀。注反者，從\n反借音讀。羅利盧栗黎藍等字，傍加口者，轉聲讀。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次念　補闕真言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後舉讚云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "末結回向偈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "願以此功德，莊嚴佛淨土，上報四重恩，下濟三途苦。若有見聞者，悉發菩提心，盡此一報身，同生極樂國。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誦\n畢，三禮而退"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翻云淨行。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐云覺護。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐高宗年號。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐云妙吉祥菩薩名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音一，禮也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音但，懼也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音渠，勤也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云總持，\n亦云遮持呪也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音丞，救󳫠也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音壑，惶恐也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵名地婆訶羅。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音絹，捨也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音易，翻也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音恣，審决也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音看，考對也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音雞。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐翻聖尊釋迦佛也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐言豐德，城名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云戰勝\n太子名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語須達多長者名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "羅漢，僧也，喻香草，含五德義。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此翻覺有情。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翻勝金南洲名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音異至也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翻遮或靜息地獄王也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音加。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音辢。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音吒。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音耶。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音但。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "波婆二音。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音朮。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音彌。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音迭。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音瀉。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音葡。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "恒河名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翻百億。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云無端正，又云非天。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翻云\n暴惡。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云可畏。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云臭餓鬼。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云奇。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云青色鬼。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "王種也，秦言田主。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翻覺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翻離垢珠寶名。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音床，旂幡屬。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "塔也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出家男僧也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出家女僧也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出家近住男女，亦名善宿男女。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在家近事男女亦名淨信士女"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "華言無上正等正覺。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "秦言大道\n菩薩。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云堅固子。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音勺，旋繞也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六通之一。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云無間。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此言滅度。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云萬億。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云正定。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音湧，瀹足蹈意。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "分二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、七返畜生，　二、受地獄苦，　三、貧胎目瞎。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、猪，　二、狗，　三、野干，　四、猴，　五、蟒，　六、鳥，　七、鷲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "開四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又分二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "花　鬘、　香　衣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一放光，　二微笑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一淨惡道，　二除生死，　三離鬼畜，　四破地獄，　五󱍧善道。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一先惡業消，　二當得淨身，　三生處不忘。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、三惡道苦破滅，　二、佛土天宮隨人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、還增壽，　二、三業淨，　三、無苦痛，　四、隨福利，　五、處安穩，　六、佛觀視，\n　七、天神護，　八、人所敬，　九、惡障除，　十、菩薩覆。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一名淨除惡道，　二名佛頂尊勝，　三名吉祥，　四名大力"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、除一切罪業等障，二、破一切穢惡道苦。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、如摩尼寶，　二、淨等虛空，三、光燄徹照。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清淨一切惡道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、閻王守護，二、地獄不墮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、同共宣說，　二、互相隨喜，　三、皆各受持，　四、一切智印。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一為破一切穢惡道苦眾生，　二為脫一切畜類閻羅王界眾生，　三為解臨急厄\n難墮苦海中眾生，　四為短命薄福無救護眾生，　五為樂造雜染惡業眾生，　六為地獄惡道眾生，\n　七為種種流轉生死眾生，　八為不信善惡業失正道眾生。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、為善住天子；　二、為一切諸天；　三、為贍部洲一切眾生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一受持，　二讀誦，　三思惟，　四愛樂，　五憶念，　六供養。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一離千劫惡業障，　二離種種苦報障"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、不落三途，　二、不受鬼神，　三、不墮畜生，　四、諸如來處，　五、菩薩補\n處，　六、婆羅門生，　七、剎利種生，　八、豪貴家生，　九、生處清淨，　十、菩提場處。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一令人喜見，　二得生善道。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、淨諸惡道，　二、滅地獄苦。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一離惡道苦，　二罪垢不染，　三諸佛受記，　四得三菩提。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一名摩訶薩，　二真是佛子，　三持法棟梁，　四即\n佛全身。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、天衣，　二、妙花，　三、塗香。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、順佛言教，　二、護自心念。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、現在冥王擁護，　二、當來不令墮獄。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一增壽命，　二離病苦，　三消\n業障，　四脫獄報。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一大疾離，　二諸病消，　三惡\n道斷，　四生淨界，　五蓮花生，　六得宿命。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一離三途\n\n苦，　二生天受樂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一現得消\n受，　二當生樂土"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、得大涅槃，　二、增\n延壽命，　三、受勝妙樂，　四、徃諸佛剎，　五、常與佛會，　六、佛為說法，　七、受佛記莂，　八、身光徧照。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一盡此一身，　二更不墮畜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此翻手印，應云：合二手掌，屈二頭指，二大拇指壓上，當其心前，誦呪百八，一名最勝\n王印，二名尊勝幢印。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、空雨花雲，　二、徧共諸佛，　三、佛讚奇善，　四、真是佛子，　五、得無礙\n智，　六、大心莊嚴。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、解脫地獄，　二、淨諸惡道，　三、增延壽命。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一一切願滿，　二脫惡道苦，　三住菩提道，　四增壽無量。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、如來，　二、呪法，　三、明驗，　四、解脫。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "花　鬘、　香　幢、　旛　葢、　衣　珞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、摩頂，　二、說法，　三、受記。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時八月初一日也，餘情縷縷，不\n及煩瑣，但望海東雲日，瞻想不盡而已"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此文出唐開元釋教錄卷第九"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "印相：二手合掌，屈二頭指甲相背，以大二指押二頂，指頭如彈\n指勢。"}
